  help: I recommend removing a and b from the declaration, like this:

            type alias Box = ...

        Why? Well, if I allowed `type alias Height 'a = Int` I would need to answer some
        weird questions. Is `Height Bool` the same as `Int`? Is `Height Bool` the same
        as `Height Int`? My solution is to not need to ask them!
